  "content": "\n\n<p>[影片預告製作中 - 即將推出！]</p>\n<p>⚠️ 重要提示：這是 Alpha / 早期存取版本，完全無法反映最終成果。開發預計於七月底結束。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d13ac17ef50ed090e7d21fcae0caf8958eeece3d.png\" alt=\"由 Sable 驅動\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Maxenonyme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-FF0000?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Ucsj7fatMj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<h1>關於 Create: Deep Seas</h1>\n<p><strong>Create: 深海</strong>（亦稱《Create 潛艇》）在《Create》的系統與 Sable 物理引擎基礎上進行擴展，讓玩家能夠建造、駕駛並在全功能、基於物理的潛艇中生存。</p>\n<p>本模組分為<strong>兩個部分</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>潛艇系統</strong>：提供壓力機制、氧氣供應，以及所有與潛艇相關的內容。</li>\n<li><strong>深淵（The Abyss）</strong>：一個包含生物與結構的未來生態系／維度，為建造與升級潛艇提供實際意義。</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>依賴模組</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Aeronautics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sable</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>** 可選，但需從以下三者中選擇其一。（僅適用於模組 2.0.0 及以上版本；低於此版本則必須安裝《Create Addition》。）</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Addition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-new-age\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create New Age</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpower-grid%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Power Grid</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>相容模組</h1>\n<h4>- Sodium（支援任何版本）</h4>\n<h4>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copycat+</a></h4>\n<h4>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwakes-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wake</a></h4>\n<h1>額外模組</h1>\n<h4>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffusion-connected-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion</a>（用於連線紋理）</h4>\n<h4>- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithostitched\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithostitched</a>（深化海洋所需）</h4>\n<h1>製作人員</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>開發者：</strong> Maxenonyme, Cogfly, Zinc Studios</li>\n<li><strong>建築師：</strong> Xamelo</li>\n<li><strong>貢獻者：</strong> T418, Soub, Mruranium</li>\n<li><strong>美術：</strong> Marume, RandomePigeon, Funado, daileta, Houslander, Myxma</li>\n<li><strong>Alpha 測試員：</strong> Gothci, Myxma, sant, qkback, Kuko, Tormi, Plasmori, Deron4iik</li>\n</ul>",
